            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton FDP-302-BP Rectangular 8  Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Large Flush Door Pull is cast in solid bronze with high quality craftsmanship. Traditional style made by master craftsman. Hamilton Bronze Patina flush door pull for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors. Any door where a \"Flush with the door face\" pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/site/product.cfm?id=204961\"><b>Smaller Rectangular 4 Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Hamilton FDP-302-BP Rectangular 8  Inch Bronze Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>1/8\" Thick Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDP-302.pdf?v=1704262229\" target=\"new\"><b>Hamilton FDP-302-BP Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued.</b> \r\n</p>",
